{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Trials of Belphegor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get Ready to Test Your Reflexes and Logic!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With only one way down, you'll need to carefully plan your moves to avoid falling\u00a0off the platform to your demise.\u00a0 \u00a0You navigate the realm of Belphegor as you compete for least moves made or fastest time to clear the tower. You are also free to go at your own pace.\u00a0<i>Trials of Belphegor blends brain teasing challenges with pixel perfect movement, drawing inspiration from the classic flash game Bloxorz while introducing unique character dynamics in an immersive fantasy setting.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udcd6Campaign Mode</strong><br>Trapped in a mysterious dungeon with no way out, a pair of prisoners must work together to navigate a series of deadly puzzles, evade sinister traps, and prove their worth while forced to move as one..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257100/extras/4d968150b3793ff7f307bf4f3b76ded1.poster.avif?t=1767962498\" width=480 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257100/extras/4d968150b3793ff7f307bf4f3b76ded1.webm?t=1767962498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257100/extras/4d968150b3793ff7f307bf4f3b76ded1.mp4?t=1767962498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Casual Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Relax and enjoy the game without the pressure of consequences. Perfect for unwinding or trying\u00a0out new strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Tower Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Set 100 years before the ultimate test of skill and strategy. With limited lives, failure means restarting from a checkpoint. Do you have what it takes to beat the puzzles at their worst?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257100/extras/177ae8d6244268ec78a0867a99009fea.poster.avif?t=1767962498\" width=480 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257100/extras/177ae8d6244268ec78a0867a99009fea.webm?t=1767962498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257100/extras/177ae8d6244268ec78a0867a99009fea.mp4?t=1767962498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Deadly Traps and Brain-Teasing Challenges</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every step could be your last. Plan your moves carefully to avoid falling victim to the dungeon\u2019s dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Leaderboards &amp; Competitive Play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Compete for the top spot in Tower Mode and Casual Mode, proving your skills against players worldwide.<br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong>Wishlist Now &amp; Prove Your Worth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgro