y Traps and Brain-Teasing Challenges</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every step could be your last. Plan your moves carefully to avoid falling victim to the dungeon\u2019s dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Leaderboards &amp; Competitive Play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Compete for the top spot in Tower Mode and Casual Mode, proving your skills against players worldwide.<br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong>Wishlist Now &amp; Prove Your Worth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["GChoc"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257100/header.jpg?t=1767962498","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3257100/788286/5b0cbac749fda050dc27e51d02c9c045f340b2ae/1750885213/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732044810","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3257100/788286/5b0cbac749fda050dc27e51d02c9c045f340b2ae/1750885213/dash_h264.mpd?t=1732044810","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3257100/788286/5b0cbac749fda050dc27e51d02c9c045f340b2ae/1750885213/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1732044810","id":257075004,"name":"TOB-Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257075004/f913d3b15d1cbe427180b9f60b5a7b5bc3c7bea6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1732044810"}],"name":"Trials Of Belphegor","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>Stora